{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_028_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ededff0bb1ce5f703eac6dd41c2a2cd15fd39f172fedf14d7e2813bb28687e7e", "ja": "（そろそろ次の公演のことを決めないとなんだけど、\n千鶴さんは……あ、いたいた。ロコ達も一緒か）", "zh": "（差不多该决定下次公演的安排了，\n千鹤呢……啊，找到了，跟ROCO她们在一起啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_028_1001_025roc", "source_sha256": "7baa781458b48cfe177e8516eae6518a4ad32e458d54c5fbca7f7273b643da7e", "ja": "チヅルも、アーティスティックな時間を\nすごしたんですか？　エクセレントです♪", "zh": "千鹤也过了一段Artistic的时光吗？\nExcellent♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_028_1002_038chz", "source_sha256": "140206d7fa66573cccb1bbfb1189507a0a8fe448713a7f6528aefb16f1828abe", "ja": "えっ？　……も、もちろん！　セレブとして、\n当然のたしなみですわ！　おーっほっほっほ！", "zh": "咦……？那、那是当然！\n身为名流，自然有如此素养！哦～呵呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_028_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "15962ba6a2189cfed21ba519531f58c4aa54999164d9238e414e8086f3692368", "ja": "あ、あれ……？　ちょっとだけ、話が\n噛み合ってないような……。気のせいかな？", "zh": "奇、奇怪了……？怎么觉得你们不是在讲同一件事……\n是我的错觉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_028_1004_p", "source_sha256": "f5024eb4290f56f6d5727904725a6dafb89062624f3c5656627685c3d1e9202e", "ja": "千鶴さん。ロコと風花も、お疲れさま！\nずいぶん盛り上がってますね。何を話してたんですか？", "zh": "千鹤，还有ROCO跟风花，辛苦了！\n看你们谈得很起劲，是在聊什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_028_1005_038chz", "source_sha256": "1c9672e0b05b284d56de41506c6f294a43ac53bd4840665a757de537fe3a1f63", "ja": "お疲れ様ですわ、{$P$}。\nえ、ええ！　アーティスティックな話を少々……。", "zh": "{$P$}，你也辛苦了。\n是、是呀！我们聊了一些艺术性的话题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_028_1006_038chz", "source_sha256": "a1f414059f255d9649a505374ffc04dc3ba35b1ca1ccbef5e6b4910f2cd95083", "ja": "それより、わたくしに何かご用ですの？", "zh": "先别说这个了，你找本小姐有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_028_1007_p", "source_sha256": "8ec6b78f82c780a7b0035e99d1b7be47cd1ec5e1b8aba0eb2f1a423451fead09", "ja": "はい。実は今度の公演、千鶴さんにセンターを\nお願いしたいと思ってるんですが、どうですか？", "zh": "是的，其实下次的公演，我想请千鹤担任Center，\n不知你意下如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_028_1008_038chz", "source_sha256": "685a26d0c3ebf95e9bd6134950fee507433cb462a512bb780583f8e30b86b910", "ja": "わ、わたくしが、センター？", "zh": "由、由本小姐担任Center？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_028_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "893b6e6f144daba158e1bafd603e4610f78bf2ca4d5807377c3a3c278e41da24", "ja": "わぁ……♪　おめでとう、千鶴ちゃん！", "zh": "哇……♪恭喜你，千鹤！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_028_1010_025roc", "source_sha256": "351e554c425835beaab7ed40c5b306e3d74cf4d06ea1ae6729632b989f870413", "ja": "マーベラスです、チヅル！\nセンター、がんばってくださいね♪", "zh": "Marvelous，千鹤！\nCenter的工作请你加油喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_028_1011_038chz", "source_sha256": "92bb31246eb598ccd031779f48593136e3e8281910d99be6de2130a2fafb2fb7", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます、ふたりとも。\n……あの、{$P$}。", "zh": "……谢、谢谢你们。\n……那个，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_028_1012_038chz", "source_sha256": "2a1c20c8426af1487613d7e0e9c8c0f034842f9bb18054d3d8242b3ea7bca7d6", "ja": "実はわたくし、すこし前から……\nセンターについて、思うことがありましたの。", "zh": "其实就在不久前，本小姐……\n对于Center产生了一些想法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_028_1013_p", "source_sha256": "fee42eadc4062d95e9cc056fe4d790dce1f52e16dc61d179a79fd0976fb34003", "ja": "センターについて、ですか？", "zh": "关于Center吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_028_1014_038chz", "source_sha256": "8d5f10bc5fe2a8ee224c3a62d890c39505b5afc92f943635b1f532e3fdedb415", "ja": "ええ。これまでセンターを経験した方には、\n内容に違いはあれど、大きな成長が感じられますわ。", "zh": "是的。虽然方向不尽相同，\n但以往担任过Center的偶像都有显著的成长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_028_1015_038chz", "source_sha256": "b4ca35b4061fd71d9f83df9a024999f611df0e8771766bf36e6efc46865a7fbe", "ja": "センターという立場がそうさせるのかと、\nわたくしなりに考えていたところでした。", "zh": "就本小姐的看法，\n可能是体验过Center的立场所促成的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_028_1016_038chz", "source_sha256": "3c435d275e083e789c5f98f67b3cb0686efbca33455189945caba0b55746fbef", "ja": "そのタイミングでの、お話……わたくしに断る理由は\nありません。センター、お引き受けいたしますわ！", "zh": "就在此时听到这个安排……本小姐没有理由拒绝。\n本小姐愿意接下Center的工作！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_028_1017_025roc", "source_sha256": "8549b466990c4a9bed3461ebdb349449d624fa8af2f733bce10afdd3cd69f360", "ja": "チヅル、ナイススピリットです！\nロコも協力しますよ！", "zh": "千鹤，Nice Spirit！\nROCO也会帮忙喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_028_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e9690915a43a0cb5081c465ed121170c3740613edf1341b37f796181cc48b53a", "ja": "千鶴ちゃん、私にも手伝わせてほしいな♪\nライブ、一緒に盛り上げようね！", "zh": "千鹤，希望你也能让我帮忙♪\n我们一起带来一场热闹的演唱会吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_028_1019_038chz", "source_sha256": "6f16fb3d2b1c3ffb490bfbcad3a88bed3269b81a79385aea6d9da41bfb38760d", "ja": "ふたりとも……ありがとう。\nこのお礼は、いつか必ずお返ししてみせますわ！", "zh": "两位……谢谢你们。\n这份恩情，本小姐来日必定会回报的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_028_1020_025roc", "source_sha256": "8747e520c55c909f4ecbd076ce81c218358431587eaf55ce717e061c59b7a7b1", "ja": "ロコは、ロコがセンターの時に助けてもらいました。\nそのお礼ですから、気にしないでください♪", "zh": "之前ROCO担任Center的时候，受到了你的帮助。\n现在ROCO只是报答你而已，请别放在心上♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_028_1021_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f7260c14331d152d777ca0527af3243501ec9aa461af2866f43b7bbaefd4e9ab", "ja": "それじゃあ私は、いつかセンターになった時に\n返してもらおうかな？　ふふっ！", "zh": "那么我就等之后有机会当上Center时，\n再请你回报啰，呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_028_1022_038chz", "source_sha256": "ee35029a0405731585df04e9c4ed8b719e12693b31819170b4af60c6c5a0dab2", "ja": "ええ、まかせてくださいまし！\n{$P$}、そういうことですから……。", "zh": "好的，尽管交给本小姐！\n{$P$}，事情就是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_028_1023_p", "source_sha256": "269c7591772dfa84749eff5cd33f8b3ab622314a01d1c480a454e064a7a1d3d3", "ja": "ロコと風花も公演のメンバーですね。\nふたりとも、よろしく頼んだぞ！", "zh": "ROCO跟风花也要当公演成员对吧？\n两位，拜托你们了喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_028_1024_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_028_1025_025roc", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_028_1026_038chz", "source_sha256": "ec8e9d72183b92d8a2279953a59e1d65b5f2220cbe19c1525e6847e56518be82", "ja": "そうと決まれば……この二階堂千鶴、\n誰よりも公演を盛り上げることをお約束しますわ！", "zh": "既然已经下了决定……本小姐二阶堂千鹤向你保证，\n会带来一场盛况空前的公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_028_1027_038chz", "source_sha256": "4217650e8da1ffe86e3418d4ae10edc23a6e87ffa9e1033742400a8ee4a3c295", "ja": "何故ならセンターとは、劇場の看板を背負って\n舞台に立つ者……つまり、セレブ中のセレブ……。", "zh": "这是因为，所谓的Center就是背负着剧场的招牌，\n站上舞台之人……也就是，名流中的名流……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_028_1028_038chz", "source_sha256": "1ebcf190336d8216854efc37af71b85bb5e6081ea011d4fe391aca96b59ab713", "ja": "そしてアイドル界の歴史を塗り変えるほど、大いに\n成長してみせますわ！　おーっほっほっほっ、ゴホッ！", "zh": "然后本小姐将会展现出能够改写偶像界历史的\n飞跃性成长！哦～呵呵呵，咳咳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_028_1029_p", "source_sha256": "147c7b2e695d876e789fea75162c5aa14e43abe748feb83d72529c2f79ad2198", "ja": "（千鶴さん……すごい気合いだ！　千鶴さんが\nファンにどんな姿を見せるのか、見届けないとな！）", "zh": "（千鹤……真是干劲十足啊！\n我得好好看着千鹤会向粉丝呈现出什么样的风采！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
